<section class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-24 md:py-36 bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto">

    <div class="max-w-5xl mb-32">
      <span class="block uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-label-md text-on-surface-variant mb-8">
        Philosophy
      </span>

      <h1 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl md:text-[96px] leading-[0.92] tracking-[-0.05em]">
        Technology should help people become more human, not less.
      </h1>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter">

      <div class="lg:col-span-4">
        <span class="text-label-md uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-on-surface-variant">
          Core Principles
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-24">

        <div class="border-t border-outline-variant pt-10">
          <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg mb-6">
            Slow Technology
          </h2>

          <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
            Most software is optimized for engagement, extraction, and endless stimulation.
            We believe digital systems should instead encourage reflection, intentionality,
            and sustainable attention.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-outline-variant pt-10">
          <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg mb-6">
            Human-Centered Systems
          </h2>

          <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
            Products should adapt to human biology and psychology rather than forcing
            people into addictive behavioral loops. Calmness is a feature.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-outline-variant pt-10">
          <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg mb-6">
            Long-Term Thinking
          </h2>

          <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
            We design for decades instead of quarterly growth spikes.
            Our systems are meant to age alongside the people using them.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-outline-variant pt-10">
          <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg mb-6">
            Digital Minimalism
          </h2>

          <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
            Simplicity creates room for thought. Interfaces should remove noise,
            reduce friction, and help people focus on what matters.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-32 bg-primary text-on-primary">
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-gutter">

    <div>
      <span class="block uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-label-md opacity-70 mb-6">
        The Goal
      </span>

      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg md:text-[72px] leading-tight">
        Build systems that help people live intentionally.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-body-lg opacity-80 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Ziyu Development exists to explore how software, hardware,
        and digital environments can support meaningful human growth.
      </p>

      <p>
        We believe the future does not need more stimulation.
        It needs more clarity, depth, and calm.
      </p>

      <p>
        Every product is an experiment in creating healthier relationships
        between people and technology.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

